    "requirements": {
      "Arbequina": 339,
      "Leccino": 612,
      "Frantoio": 671
    },
    "caution": "Region-calibrated flowering model; not validated for Hawaii. Arbosana and Koroneiki requirements are not numerically parameterized here. No CU are computed from quarterly means or incomplete daily station observations."
  },
