          "label": "Cultivar-dependent fruiting",
          "explanation": "Arbequina, Arbosana and Koroneiki repeatedly fruited in 2013–15. Yields were low and uneven; this does not establish dependable commercial crops. The generic grid is not applicable as a blanket no-fruiting verdict here."
        },
        "Arbequina": {
          "category": "conditional",
          "label": "Fruiting demonstrated · reliability unproven",
          "explanation": "Arbequina fruited in 2013–15 at the irrigated high-elevation trial. Seven trees per cultivar; 2013–14 mean yields across the three cultivars were 2.14–2.45 kg/tree. In 2015 only two trees per cultivar were harvested after substantial fruit drop."
        },
